# Architectural Diagrams

## Pipeline Flowchart {#pipeline}

```mermaid
%%{init: {"flowchart": {"defaultRenderer": "elk"}} }%%
flowchart TD
  Source[Source .pdx Files] --> Compiler[Lumen AST Compiler]
  Compiler --> SSR[Static HTML SSR]
  Compiler --> MD[Clean Markdown Mirrors]
  Compiler --> Typst[Typst Academic PDF Engine]
  SSR --> Dist[Output Distribution]
  MD --> Dist
  Typst --> Dist
```

## State Machine {#state-machine}

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Review: Submit
  Review --> Verified: Corpus Gates Pass
  Review --> Rejected: Gate Violations
  Rejected --> Draft: Edit
  Verified --> [*]
```
